{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866130/extras/7c82745b3a9544aa49701eead19ebfdf.poster.avif?t=1769446067\" width=960 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866130/extras/7c82745b3a9544aa49701eead19ebfdf.webm?t=1769446067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Explore the remains of a distant dystopian future and survive a brutal world where you can expect high-octane, fast-paced action. Master dozens of unique combos to wreak havoc upon your enemies.<br>Forged with grit and sharpened by passion, this fast-paced rogue-lite lets you shapeshift between characters mid-combat so you can combine abilities to stylishly destroy your opponents.<br>Clear levels, grow stronger, unlock powerful upgrades.<br>But die\u2026 and it\u2019s all gone... until you pick yourself up again.<br><br>Born as a solo university side project, Morbid Metal eventually evolved into a full-on team effort. It\u2019s the first game from SCREEN JUICE, the indie studio founded by the creator of the original project.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866130/extras/34d8e6d9a0d23ad33a21ad61334af424.poster.avif?t=1769446067\" width=960 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866130/extras/34d8e6d9a0d23ad33a21ad61334af424.webm?t=1769446067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>In this rogue-lite, surviving means switching characters on the fly like you would switch weapons in an FPS.<br>Each member of your team has their own specific move sets and special signature skill. Chain attacks together to create unique combos and leave nothing but carnage behind.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866130/extras/a477aa3ccd39f9db2bd0b226bf770169.poster.avif?t=1769446067\" width=960 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866130/extras/a477aa3ccd39f9db2bd0b226bf770169.webm?t=1769446067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>With each run, upgrade your characters and progressively grow stronger to annihilate your enemies. Evolve mid-run, gather Routines, unlock Protocol Buffs, and spend Void Matter to grow stronger. Death resets the cycle. But persistent upgrades ensure no run is ever the same. You die, you adapt, you evolve.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866130/extras/03aa936e61ded69da8c7cd6a6cbaa73b.poster.avif?t=1769446067\" width=960 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866130/extras/03aa936e61ded69da8c7cd6a6cbaa73b.webm?t=1769446067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>In a post-collapse simulation, you are the last AI built by a mysterious Operator. Your mission: eliminate corrupted kin and transcend mankind. Each cycle reveals fragments of a forgotten truth. Progress through stunning, high-fidelity graphics showing mankind\u2019s self-inflicted downfall.<br>Fight, die, and return...until you understand what you truly are.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866130/extras/d5cb07fcf36af68e0a41f9aa33d12e76.poster.avif?t=1769446067\" width=960 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866130/extras/d5cb07fcf36af68e0a41f9aa33d12e76.webm?t=1769446067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1866130?t=1769446067","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866130/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769446067","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866130/1682e3bcf499a1cd1c822dffbf44d06a0d717772/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769446067","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866130/1682e3bcf499a1cd1c822dffbf44d06a0d717772/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769446067","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3762220,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866130/extras/7c82745b3a9544aa49701eead19ebfdf.poster.avif?t=1769446067\" width=960 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866130/extras/7c82745b3a9544aa49701eead19ebfdf.webm?t=1769446067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Explore the remains of a distant dystopian future and survive a brutal world where you can expect high-octane, fast-paced action. Master dozens of unique combos to wreak havoc upon your enemies.<br>Forged with grit and sharpened by passion, this fast-paced rogue-lite lets you shapeshift between characters mid-combat so you can combine abilities to stylishly destroy your opponents.<br>Clear levels, grow stronger, unlock powerful upgrades.<br>But die\u2026 and it\u2019s all gone... until you pick yourself up again.<br><br>Born as a solo univer